Subject: [PATCH 08/12] platform/x86: intel_cht_int33fe: Provide fwnode for the USB connector
Date:   Fri, 15 Mar 2019 19:57:56 +0300
Message-Id: <20190315165800.5058-9-heikki.krogerus@linux.intel.com>
